Package: dataraft.ide
Title: Metadata Bridge for DataRaft IDE Tools
Version: 0.1.0.9005
Authors@R: person("Jan-Hendrik", "Weinert", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "65009403+JanWein@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Exposes bounded, allowlisted DataRaft metadata to IDE clients.
    Provides a private file response protocol, explicit trial and data viewer
    commands, and workspace discovery without evaluating source expressions.
